      "html": "<p>Weronika is a Data Scientist at Unit8, driving digital transformations by turning customers' data into working systems. Curious by nature, she is excited to find real-world rules by exploring datasets. Weronika shares some personality traits with her beloved golden retrievers – energetic, trusting, always taking a joyous and playful approach to life, and hoping to maintain this puppyish behavior all life long!</p>"
